pan><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-1\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-1\">🎯 定位为什么能定生死？</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-2\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-2\">🚲 商业IP的核心定位长什么样？</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-3\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-3\">🔄 IP变现的完整闭环是哪7步？</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-4\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-4\">📊 获客漏斗到底有多残酷？</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-5\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-5\">🎯 获客到底在获哪一层客户？</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-6\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-6\">🗣️ 流量→营销→交付，三步怎么走？</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-7\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-7\">🤖 怎么让AI说出\"你的话\"？</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-8\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-8\">📝 商业自画像怎么搭？（四步模板）</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"2\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row is-collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"immersive-outline-caret\" data-caret-for=\"immersive-outline-9\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"折叠 智能体链接\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#chevron\"></use></svg></button><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-9\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-9\">智能体链接</a></div><ul class=\"immersive-outline-list\" data-branch-for=\"immersive-outline-9\"><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"3\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link\" href=\"#immersive-outline-10\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-10\">黄金人设：</a></div></li><li class=\"immersive-outline-item\" data-level=\"3\"><div class=\"immersive-outline-row\"><span class=\"immersive-outline-caret-spacer\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><a class=\"immersive-outline-link is-active\" href=\"#immersive-outline-11\" data-outline-target=\"immersive-outline-11\">商业自画像：</a></div></li></ul></li></ul></nav>\n  </aside>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"immersive-outline-restore\" data-outline-restore=\"\" aria-label=\"展开目录\" aria-expanded=\"false\" hidden=\"\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#chevron\"></use></svg>\n    <span>目录</span>\n  </button>\n  <main class=\"workspace-main\">\n    <header class=\"topbar immersive-standard-topbar\">\n      <div class=\"topbar-left\">\n        <button class=\"mobile-menu\" type=\"button\" data-open-sidebar=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#menu\"></use></svg></button>\n        <div><span>REQUIRED LESSON</span><h1><a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/library.html?section=required\">必修课</a><i>/</i> 课程详情</h1></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"topbar-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"global-search-trigger\" data-open-search=\"\" aria-label=\"打开全站搜索\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#search\"></use></svg><span>搜索</span><kbd>⌘K</kbd></button>\n        <a class=\"back-dashboard\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/library.html?section=required\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#chevron\"></use></svg><span>返回必修课</span></a>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n  <section class=\"immersive-shell\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n    <header class=\"immersive-topbar\">\n      <div>\n        <span>REQUIRED LESSON</span>\n        <h1 data-immersive-title=\"\">【AI精准获客】第1课：定位定生死</h1>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"immersive-actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"favorite-btn\" id=\"favorite-btn\" data-favorite-btn=\"\"><span data-favorite-text=\"\">⭐️我先关注</span></button>\n        <a class=\"immersive-ghost\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/library.html?section=required\">退出</a>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n    <section class=\"immersive-control-card\">\n      <div class=\"immersive-password\">\n        <small>访问密码</small>\n        <strong data-immersive-password=\"\">77DL</strong>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-copy-password=\"\">复制密码</button>\n      </div>\n      <p data-immersive-note=\"\">商业IP的本质不是涨粉，而是用\"有趣+有用+互动\"的精准定位，先跑通MVP变现，再筛选精准客户打通和放大闭环，定位和变现闭环才是生死线。</p>\n      <div class=\"immersive-control-actions\">\n        <a class=\"content-button\" data-open-original=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://meeting.tencent.com/crm/KPWP3wdY8a\">新窗口打开</a>\n        <button class=\"content-button secondary\" type=\"button\" data-fullscreen=\"\" hidden=\"\">全屏观看</button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"immersive-viewer\" id=\"immersive-viewer\" hidden=\"\">\n      <iframe title=\"课程录制\" data-immersive-frame=\"\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"fullscreen; encrypted-media; clipboard-write\" hidden=\"\"></iframe>\n      <div class=\"immersive-launch-card\" id=\"immersive-launch\" hidden=\"\">\n        <div class=\"immersive-launch-icon\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#play\"></use></svg></div>\n        <span data-launch-kicker=\"\">腾讯会议录制</span>\n        <h2 data-launch-title=\"\">【AI精准获客】第1课：定位定生死</h2>\n        <p data-launch-desc=\"\">腾讯会议录制不支持在第三方网页内直接嵌入播放。请先复制访问密码，再打开腾讯会议录制页面观看。</p>\n        <div class=\"immersive-launch-password\">\n          <small>访问密码</small>\n          <strong data-launch-password=\"\">77DL</strong>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"immersive-launch-actions\">\n          <button class=\"content-button secondary\" type=\"button\" data-copy-password=\"\">复制密码</button>\n          <a class=\"content-button\" data-launch-open=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://meeting.tencent.com/crm/KPWP3wdY8a\">打开腾讯会议录制</a>\n        </div>\n        <em>已为你保留沉浸式页面，只把播放动作交给腾讯会议原页面完成。</em>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"immersive-notes has-two-cards\" id=\"immersive-notes\">\n      <article class=\"immersive-note-card\" data-content-points-card=\"\">\n        <span>CONTENT POINTS</span>\n        <h2>内容要点</h2>\n        <div class=\"immersive-note-body\" data-content-points=\"\"><figure class=\"doc-image\"><img src=\"/api/assets/asset_f345e3b7e106860cd1bc35b4\" alt=\"文档图片\" loading=\"lazy\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"文档图片，点击查看大图\" data-lightbox-src=\"/api/assets/asset_f345e3b7e106860cd1bc35b4\"></figure><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-1\">🎯 定位为什么能定生死？</h2><p>做IP的第一步不是拍视频，是想清楚谁给你钱。定位的本质 = 我是谁 + 客户是谁 + 怎么帮他 + 拿到什么结果。</p><p>五大常见坑：定位模糊什么都想做、只输出干货没个人色彩、追热点追到迷失自己、高开低走更新断崖、把涨粉当目标而非变现力。</p><p>IP本质：不是说你自己想讲的，是帮客户说出他想讲但讲不出口的话。</p><p>两条路线：电商路线靠流量带货 vs 专业路线靠专业变现；普通人走专业路线，做\"有专业度的活人\"，你是谁就服务谁。</p><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-2\">🚲 商业IP的核心定位长什么样？</h2><p>像一辆自行车，两个轮子 + 一根链条才能跑起来。</p><p>前轮=有趣：别人喜欢你才愿意靠近你，板着脸没人愿意掏钱。</p><p>后轮=有用的方案：能真解决问题，牙疼就治牙，别治腿。</p><p>链条=互动：驱动力靠互动，有趣+有用+互动，IP才能往前跑。</p><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-3\">🔄 IP变现的完整闭环是哪7步？</h2><p>从冷启动到规模化，先跑通变现再做内容，顺序不能反。</p><p>定位：找准你是谁、服务谁</p><p>MVP验证：最短时间让对方赚到钱，私域能变现说明定位有效；变不了现就别做大量内容，等于给平台免费打工</p><p>内容放大：内容即营销、内容即获客，短视频/直播/小红书/公众号全渠道铺</p><p>产品打薄：把MVP阶段的1对1服务，做成自动化、标准化产品，减少自己时间投入</p><p>引流系统：从内容到成交的路径，持续升级优化</p><p>销转：把信任变成成交</p><p>交付即营销：服务完要见证、要锦旗、要故事；厂长专门做了一个案例库账号，这是最高级的获客</p><p>说白了，冷启动阶段先造个产品赶紧卖，海报都可以没有，有人买单才算启动成功。</p><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-4\">📊 获客漏斗到底有多残酷？</h2><p>1万个人看到 → 500人点击 → 50人留客资 → 20人深度沟通 → 1人成交，转化率约5%；复购/转介绍约0.3。</p><p>止损率法则：花100分精力服务100个泛客户，不如花100分精力服务10个精准客户。</p><p>AI的作用：帮你快速过滤出那10个精准的，核心精力砸在他们身上。</p><p>律师赛道获客成本：5247元/人；传统教育行业几十到几百，所以留住老客户极其重要。</p><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-5\">🎯 获客到底在获哪一层客户？</h2><p>客户分9层，从0（你自己）到9（大众粉），越往外漏斗越宽、越不精准。</p><p>9=大众粉：讲大众话题增粉最快，但不精准</p><p>6=精准客户/线索客户：话题窄但转化高，100元以内的低客单（5块2、19块9）都属线索层</p><p>3=高价值客户：通常3万起，高净值人群可能从6直接跳到3，不走漏斗</p><p>流失客户：服务完的客户最值钱，口碑好转介绍、口碑差坏名声，必须善待</p><p>增粉讲大众话题，获客讲精准话题——腰部IP和刚起步的，别贪流量，先抓精准。</p><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-6\">🗣️ 流量→营销→交付，三步怎么走？</h2><p>流量做筛选，营销讲人话，交付做口碑。</p><p>流量端：做筛选，让对的人看到你；投流也要精准</p><p>营销端：把专业内容翻译成信任内容，讲人话、讲价值语言</p><p>交付端：10倍好的交付 → 打造人设 → 做见证 → 形成新流量内容，闭环</p><p>见证要主动要：给用户两个版本的话术让他选，剩下的你全干了，用户零成本就愿意配合</p><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-7\">🤖 怎么让AI说出\"你的话\"？</h2><p>核心是活人感，得让AI清楚知道你是谁、你的客户是谁。</p><p>IP人设四要素：专业背景、表达风格、做事风格、价值观</p><p>用户画像三要素：对方是谁、有什么痛点、有什么渴望</p><p>表达越精准，AI出的内容越像你；35岁客户和60岁客户，讲话方式完全不一样</p><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-8\">📝 商业自画像怎么搭？（四步模板）</h2><p>这是所有AI智能体的根基，后面所有课都靠它。</p><p>个人基础信息：行业年限、服务客户数、成绩、专业认证——凸显资深</p><p>核心产品与服务：客户场景 + 解决方案 + 具体案例——增强代入</p><p>不可取代优势：规模大、权威高、证据真——建立信任</p><p>规模大：私域32万人 vs 1万人</p><p>权威高：官方认证、牛人公开夸奖</p><p>证据真：转账截图、社群好评、有图有真相</p><p>目标用户画像：人群、年龄、收入、职业、现状、困扰、渴望、犹豫原因——越细越好</p><p>AI不做终稿，人工不做初稿——AI生成后必须自己二次审查优化，不能直接用。</p><h2 data-level=\"2\" id=\"immersive-outline-9\">智能体链接</h2><h3 data-level=\"3\" id=\"immersive-outline-10\">黄金人设：</h3><p><a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/content.html?id=recvrZ6AbPlqHm&amp;section=tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wxgaochu.com/member/content.html?id=recvrZ6AbPlqHm&amp;section=tools</a></p><h3 data-level=\"3\" id=\"immersive-outline-11\">商业自画像：</h3><p><a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/content.html?id=recvrZ6AbPSGCH&amp;section=tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.wxgaochu.com/member/content.html?id=recvrZ6AbPSGCH&amp;section=tools</a></p></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"immersive-note-card\" data-homework-card=\"\" data-collapse-bound=\"1\" aria-expanded=\"true\">\n        <span>ACTION</span>\n        <h2>待办或作业</h2>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"immersive-homework-toggle\" aria-controls=\"immersive-homework-body\" aria-label=\"收起待办或作业\" aria-expanded=\"true\">收起</button><div class=\"immersive-note-body\" data-homework-text=\"\" id=\"immersive-homework-body\"><p>✅ 课后作业（必做，下节课要用）</p><p>填写商业自画像模板（四部分：基础信息、产品服务、核心优势、用户画像）</p><p>用提供的智能体链接生成完善版商业自画像</p><p>基于自己的理解人工优化，输出最终版</p><p>重点保留客户购买决策障碍部分（价格成本、信任风险、认知价值、时间精力、资源能力、结果不确定、决策复杂度、机会成本共8类），后面所有智能体都要用</p><p>优化好的版本就是你未来所有AI获客工具的\"根\"，这一步做扎实，后面事半功倍。</p></div>\n      </article>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"course-practice\" data-course-practice=\"\"><span class=\"course-practice-label\">把所学用在自己的业务里</span><h2>学完就试一次</h2><p class=\"course-practice-guide\">✅ 课后作业（必做，下节课要用）\n填写商业自画像模板（四部分：基础信息、产品服务、核心优势、用户画像）\n用提供的智能体链接生成完善版商业自画像\n基于自己的理解人工优化，输出最终版\n重点保留客户购买决策障碍部分（价格成本、信任风险、认知价值、时间精力、资源能力、结果不确定、决策复杂度、机会成本共8类），后面所有智能体都要用\n优化好的版本就是你未来所有AI获客工具的\"根\"，这一步做扎实，后面事半功倍。</p><form><textarea required=\"\" maxlength=\"1000\" placeholder=\"我准备做的具体动作…\" aria-label=\"课程实践动作\"></textarea><div class=\"course-practice-actions\"><button type=\"submit\" value=\"weekly\">加入本周行动</button><button type=\"submit\" value=\"note\">保存为经营笔记</button></div><p role=\"status\"></p></form></section>\n    <!-- 页面底部数据统计：本页浏览 x 次 · 会员 y 位（放在 immersive-shell 末尾 = 全页最底部） -->\n    <p class=\"page-view-stats\" data-page-view-stats=\"\">本页浏览 6 次 · 会员 4 位</p>\n  </section>\n  </main>\n  <div class=\"workspace-toast\" id=\"workspace-toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n\n\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"sidebar-restore\" data-sidebar-restore=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\" title=\"打开菜单\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#menu\"></use></svg></button><div class=\"nav-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\"></div><div class=\"global-search-dialog\" data-global-search-dialog=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n    <div class=\"global-search-backdrop\" data-close-search=\"\"></div>\n    <section class=\"global-search-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"global-search-title\">\n      <header>\n        <div><span>GLOBAL SEARCH</span><h2 id=\"global-search-title\">全站搜索</h2></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-close-search=\"\" aria-label=\"关闭搜索\">×</button>\n      </header>\n      <label class=\"global-search-field\">\n        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#spark\"></use></svg>\n        <input type=\"search\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"搜索你感兴趣的任何内容吧\" aria-label=\"搜索关键词\">\n        <kbd>ESC</kbd>\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"global-search-status\">输入关键词，快速找到可以继续使用的内容。</div>\n      <div class=\"global-search-results\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n    </section></div><div class=\"global-search-dialog daily-action-dialog\" data-daily-action-dialog=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n    <div class=\"global-search-backdrop\" data-close-daily=\"\"></div>\n    <section class=\"global-search-panel daily-action-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"daily-action-title\">\n      <header>\n        <div><span>DAILY CHECK-IN</span><h2 id=\"daily-action-title\">今日行动 <small class=\"daily-action-brand\">每日出摊</small></h2></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-close-daily=\"\" aria-label=\"关闭今日行动\">×</button>\n      </header>\n      <p class=\"daily-action-hint\">辛苦一天不容易，赶紧记一笔，再小的成果也是进步。</p>\n      <form data-daily-action-form=\"\" class=\"daily-action-form\">\n        <fieldset>\n          <legend>行动类型 <em class=\"required\">必填</em></legend>\n          <div class=\"daily-action-options\">\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_moments\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了条朋友圈</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"xhs_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>写了篇小红书</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_channels_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了视频号</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_oa_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>写了篇公众号</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_oa_card\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发布了公众号贴图</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"short_video\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了短视频</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"long_video\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了长视频</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"qa_answer\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>问答平台答了题</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"client_followup\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>聊了老客户</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"self_media_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>自媒体平台发文</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"deal_closed\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>做了个成交</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"private_pool_growth\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>又加了私域</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"scroll_douyin\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>学习了抖音对标博主</span>\n    </label></div>\n        </fieldset>\n        <label class=\"daily-action-field\">\n          <span>行动标题</span>\n          <input type=\"text\" name=\"title\" maxlength=\"120\" placeholder=\"选填 · 写下今天发出去的内容标题\" data-daily-title=\"\">\n          <small>带标题的记录会展示在 <a href=\"/creator-workbench/member/member-profile.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">你的会员主页</a>，点击可直接跳转查看。</small>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"daily-action-field\">\n          <span>行动网址</span>\n          <input type=\"url\" name=\"url\" maxlength=\"500\" placeholder=\"选填 · 其他会员有权限点击查看\" data-daily-url=\"\">\n          <small>其他会员有权限点击查看。</small>\n        </label>\n        <div class=\"daily-action-actions\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"secondary-action\" data-close-daily=\"\">取消</button>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"meeting-primary\" data-daily-submit=\"\">记一笔今日行动</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"form-status\" data-daily-status=\"\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n      </form>\n    </section></div><a id=\"bottomBar\" style=\"position: fixed; bottom: -40px; left: 0px; z-index: 9999; transform: translateX(-50%); background-color: transparent; border-radius: 5px 5px 0px 0px; opacity: 0.3; padding: 5px; transition: 0.3s; cursor: pointer; max-height: 100px; max-width: 45px;\"><img src=\"chrome-extension://kobncfkmjelbefaoohoblamnbackjggk/icon/icon_32.png\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px;\"></a></body><plasmo-csui id=\"aitdk-csui\"></plasmo-csui><div id=\"immersive-translate-popup\" style=\"all: initial\"></div></html>", "controls": [{"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "button", "text": "隐藏菜单", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": [["data-sidebar-collapse", ""]]}, {"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "button", "text": "看清业务", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": [["data-tooltip", "先把业务看清：我服务谁、解决什么问题，现在卡在哪，下一步往哪里走。"]]}, {"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "button", "text": "日常工作", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": [["data-tooltip", "每天真正要做的事：让 AI 帮一把、跟进客户、整理会议、记下想法。"]]}, {"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "button", "text": "学习提升", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": [["data-tooltip", "按基本功、进阶打法、真实案例和经营资源四个方向补能力。选一节适合当前问题的课，学完试着用到业务中。"]]}, {"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "button", "text": "会员服务", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": [["data-tooltip", "权益、活动、积分与成长记录，都在这里查看和使用。"]]}, {"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "button", "text": "账户与设置", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": [["data-tooltip", "管理个人资料、主题与账号安全；运营后台仅对有权限的账号显示。"]]}, {"tag": "DIV", "id": "", "text": "何\n演示用户\n天使", "attributes": [["data-settings-link-ready", "1"]]}, {"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "button", "text": "收起目录", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": [["data-close-outline", ""]]}, {"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "button", "text": "折叠 智能体链接", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": [["data-caret-for", "immersive-outline-9"]]}, {"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "button", "text": "搜索\n⌘K", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": [["data-open-search", ""]]}, {"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "favorite-btn", "name": "", "type": "button", "text": "⭐️我先关注", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": [["data-favorite-btn", ""]]}, {"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "button", "text": "复制密码", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": [["data-copy-password", ""]]}, {"tag": "IMG", "id": "", "name": "", "text": "文档图片，点击查看大图", "attributes": [["data-lightbox-src", "/api/assets/asset_f345e3b7e106860cd1bc35b4"]]}, {"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "button", "text": "收起", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": []}, {"tag": "TEXTAREA", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "textarea", "text": "课程实践动作", "value": "", "disabled": false, "attributes": []}, {"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "submit", "text": "加入本周行动", "value": "weekly", "disabled": false, "attributes": []}, {"tag": "BUTTON", "id": "", "name": "", "type": "submit", "text": "保存为经营笔记", "value": "note", "disabled": false, "attributes": []}]}